| 4 | 6 | 4 | 0 |
| 8 | 28 | 8 | 0 |
| 16 | 120 | 16 | 0 |
| 32 | 496 | 32 | 0 |
| 64 | 2016 | 64 | 0 |
\image(figures/schensted_work.svg)
